        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-19T16:19:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need to clarify the role of this variable by choosing a good name for it. Currently it\u0027s unclear why it has to be stored separately from `mSubmixRoutes`. Is this intended to be a cached variable, a \u0027current\u0027 route, or a temporary route which is not in that vector yet?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 119,
        "startChar": 33,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "0bb7b9a823a708b14c31dd7a71863cc6be46aef2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
